{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "102", "sample_idx": 9, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "\"Honestly, Beatrice, are you *sure* about this?\" Mark asked, pulling his sweatshirt tighter around him. He slumped onto the edge of the plush velvet sofa.\n\nBeatrice twirled, the silk of her emerald green ball gown shimmering under the chandelier light. \"Mark, darling, of course! It's the annual Starlight Soiree. It's *the* event of the season. And you look…comfortable. But not exactly ready for glittering chandeliers and polite conversation.\"\n\nMark sighed. \"Comfortable is good. I'm expecting a lot of forced smiles and small talk about investments. I'd rather be home with a book.\"\n\n\"Nonsense! It'll be fun. Besides, Mrs. Abernathy specifically asked *me* to bring you. She said you have insightful opinions on…antique clock mechanisms, was it?\" Beatrice adjusted a stray strand of her hair.\n\n\"Right. Antique clocks. My area of expertise. Riveting stuff.\" Mark deadpanned. \"Do I *have* to wear this…this…disguise?\" He gestured vaguely at his sweats.\n\nBeatrice chuckled. \"Don't be silly. It's perfectly acceptable. Though perhaps a slightly nicer pair of sweats? Look, just try to be sociable. And don't spill anything on my dress.\"\n\n\"No promises.\"\n\n* I'm really hoping I can sneak a nap in the library.\n* I packed extra earplugs. Just in case.\n* I brought a book about the history of doorknobs.\n\n\n\n\"Alright, alright. Let's go then. Try not to scare the guests with your…relaxed demeanor.\" Beatrice offered him her arm with a dazzling smile. Mark reluctantly took it, feeling incredibly out of place.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "\"", "logprob": -0.06534682214260101}, {"token": "Honestly", "logprob": -1.5186002254486084}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.2040065485052764e-05}, {"token": "▁Beatrice", "logprob": -0.06726166605949402}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0031874587293714285}, {"token": "▁are", "logprob": -0.01593075506389141}, {"toke